# HopeBridge environment variables (documentation)

Copy relevant values into Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables.
Do not commit real secrets.

## Public site / SEO

NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://hopebridge-foundation-five.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://hopebridge-foundation-five.vercel.app
GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

## Capacitor native shells

CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=https://hopebridge-foundation-five.vercel.app

## Server-only (never ship to mobile binaries)

OPENAI_API_KEY=
